 pre-wrap; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">colour </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">in colour\" (e.g. if \"cat\", \"3\" and \"white\" are entered, it will store \"your cat is 3 years old and white in colour\")</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">3. display </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">sentence </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">in lowercase format and uppercase format in separate lines. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Follow the test output display format.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Test Input\n</span></u></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dog\n7\nBrown</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Fish\n2\nGold</span><br></p><p></p><p><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\